{"t": 24.0, "command": "done", "args": ["Added a Battery element to the Home HAEO hub. Connection: Inverter (DC, the default, since the battery sits behind the inverter). Capacity: Sigen Plant Rated Energy Capacity sensor (32.24 kWh). State of charge: Sigen Plant Battery State of Charge sensor (%). Min charge level: fixed 5 %. Max charge power: Sigen Plant ESS Rated Charging Power sensor. Max discharge power: Sigen Plant ESS Rated Discharging Power sensor. Battery name, max charge level, salvage and cost fields, and efficiency/advanced settings were left at defaults. The success dialog said 'Created configuration for Battery' and the Battery device now appears under Home."], "error": null, "visible_errors": 0}
